<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41036" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-mī^gro</span></b> ,
			āre, v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to remove</i> or <i>journey back; to go back</i>, <i>return</i>
			(class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">facere ut remigret domum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Pers. 4, 6, 3</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in domum suam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Tusc. 1, 49, 118</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in domum veterem e novā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Ac. 1, 4, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in locum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					2, 966</span></i>
			. trans Rhenum in suos vicos, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. G.
			4</span></i>. 4: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in agros,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 27</span></i>
			
			<i>fin.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Romam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 9, 18, 4</span></i>
			.— <b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subitum est ei remigrare Kalendis Quintilibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 9, 13, 2</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ad argumentum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. prol. 47</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ad justitiam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 5, 21, 62</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ad deos (anima sapientis),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Dogm. Plat. 2, p. 23, 19</span></i>
			. remigrat animus nunc demum mihi, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ep.
				4, 1, 42</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
